        order: 15,
        body: "ADR auditors examining F2F compliance will: verify that F2F documentation exists for the episode; verify the encounter date falls within the F2F window; verify the practitioner is a qualifying practitioner; and verify the documentation contains the required clinical findings and attestation. The absence of a qualifying practitioner's note — and substitution of the agency's clinical documentation — is an immediate denial. Surveyors will also verify that the certifying physician does not have a prohibited financial relationship with the agency.\n\n---",
