        title: "OASIS Quality Reviewer Scoring Verification",
        level: 3,
        order: 9,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | OASIS Quality Reviewer | For every SOC assessment reviewed per CL-OA-002: (a) independently re-calculate the BIMS total score from the documented component scores; (b) independently re-calculate the PHQ-2 total score from the documented item scores; (c) if PHQ-9 was administered, independently re-calculate the PHQ-9 total score from all 9 item scores; (d) verify that the calculated totals match the documented totals; (e) verify that the documented totals map to the coded OASIS item responses. | Within the Level 2 review timeline per CL-OA-002. |\n| 6.2.2 | OASIS Quality Reviewer | If any scoring discrepancy is identified (component scores that do not sum to the documented total, or a total score that does not map to the coded OASIS response), classify the discrepancy as a scoring error and initiate the correction process per CL-OA-002. | Within 24 hours of identification. |\n\n---",
