        body: "10.1 All authorized OASIS assessors shall demonstrate scoring competency for the BIMS and PHQ-2/PHQ-9 as part of the initial OASIS Competency Program and annual re-competency per CL-OA-003. Scoring competency requires correctly scoring simulated tool responses using the exact algorithms in Section 5.\n10.2 All personnel within scope shall sign the Policy Acknowledgment Form (Appendix A) within 14 calendar days.\n\n---",
