        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | Director of Nursing | Alert each assessor 60 days before their authorization anniversary date that annual re-validation is required. Schedule the re-validation to be completed before the anniversary date. | 60 days before anniversary date per CL-OA-003. |\n| 6.2.2 | Director of Nursing / Evaluator | Administer the Annual Re-Validation Written Assessment covering: (a) any changes to the CMS OASIS-E2 Guidance Manual since the prior re-validation; (b) items where the assessor had documented accuracy deficiencies in the prior year's monthly audit results; (c) high-risk coding areas (GG functional items, wound staging, BIMS scoring). 25-item assessment; minimum 85% passing score. | At the annual re-validation session. |\n| 6.2.3 | Director of Nursing / Evaluator | Administer BIMS Direct Observation Re-Demonstration (mandatory annually regardless of prior-year accuracy): the assessor demonstrates the complete BIMS administration to a simulated patient using the Domain 3 evaluation checklist (Appendix C). Passing standard: same as initial. | At the annual re-validation session. |\n| 6.2.4 | Director of Nursing | If the assessor had any Domain 4 (scoring accuracy) or Domain 5 (item-level coding) deficiency in the prior year's monthly audits (any item category below 90%): administer the targeted re-validation exercise for the deficient domain(s) using the same instruments as the initial evaluation. If no prior-year deficiency, Domains 4 and 5 re-validation is waived for the current annual cycle. | At the annual re-validation session if deficiency present. |\n| 6.2.5 | Director of Nursing | If the assessor had no prior-year deficiencies in Domains 6 and 7 (documentation and supervised assessment), the Supervised SOC Assessment is waived for the annual re-validation. If a Domain 6 or 7 deficiency was identified in the prior year's audits, a supervised assessment is required. | At the annual re-validation session if deficiency present. |\n| 6.2.6 | Director of Nursing | Complete the OASIS Competency Validation Record (Appendix A) for the annual re-validation and file in the personnel file. Update the Authorized Assessor Roster per CL-OA-003. | Within 5 business days of re-validation completion. |\n\n---",
