        order: 4,
        body: "This policy applies to all occupational therapists (OTs), certified occupational therapy assistants (COTAs), the Director of Nursing / Clinical Manager, Clinical Coordinators, and Revenue Cycle staff verifying OT documentation supports billed claims.\n\n---",
