        level: 2,
        order: 4,
        body: "This policy applies to:\nAll registered nurses (RNs) providing skilled nursing to patients with serious, advanced, or life-limiting illness\nAll licensed vocational nurses (LVNs) who may encounter patients with palliative care needs\nAll clinical disciplines (PT, OT, SLP, MSW) whose services intersect with palliative care goals\nMedical Social Workers — the primary coordinator of psychosocial palliative care support and hospice referral\nThe Director of Nursing / Clinical Manager\nAll clinical disciplines who interact with patients approaching end of life\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
