        body: "### Appendix A — Goals-of-Care Conversation Documentation Template\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. | Policy Reference: CL-SD-023 | Version: 1.0\n\n| Field | Documentation |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name / MR# |  |\n| Date of Conversation |  |\n| Location |  |\n| Participants (name and relationship to patient) |  |\n| PATIENT'S UNDERSTANDING | What the patient/family understands about the diagnosis and prognosis: |\n| PATIENT'S VALUES AND GOALS | What matters most to the patient (expressed in patient's own words): |\n| PATIENT'S FEARS AND CONCERNS | What the patient is most afraid of: |\n| TREATMENT PREFERENCES | CPR preference: ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ Not discussed |\n| HOSPICE DISCUSSED | ☐ Yes — Patient response: ☐ Interested ☐ Not interested at this time ☐ Wants more information |\n| PHYSICIAN INVOLVEMENT | ☐ Physician participated ☐ Physician notified of conversation — Date: |\n| PLAN GOING FORWARD |  |\n| ADVANCE DIRECTIVE STATUS | ☐ Current on file ☐ Update needed ☐ None — Patient interest in completing: ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Clinician | Name / Credential / Date |\n\n### Appendix B — Policy Acknowledgment Form\n\n| Field | Response |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) |  |\n| Title / Role |  |\n| Signature |  |\n| Date Signed |  |\n\nCollected By: _________________________ Date Filed: _____________\n\n---",
