        id: "8-minimum-qualifications",
        title: "Minimum Qualifications",
        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Requirement | Standard |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Education | Bachelor's degree preferred; equivalent professional compliance experience may substitute. |\n| Experience | Minimum 2 years of experience in healthcare compliance, regulatory affairs, or health care law; home health experience strongly preferred. |\n| Knowledge | Working knowledge of: Medicare home health Conditions of Participation (42 CFR Part 484); OIG Compliance Program Guidance; HIPAA Privacy and Security Rules; False Claims Act; Anti-Kickback Statute; CMS billing requirements for home health. |\n| Certification | Certified in Healthcare Compliance (CHC) through the Compliance Certification Board preferred; not required if experience standard is met. |\n| Exclusion Screening | Must not appear on OIG LEIE or SAM exclusion lists at time of designation and must clear monthly screening thereafter per policy HR-TA-003. |\n| Background | Must pass criminal background check per policy HR-TA-002. |\n\n---",
