        body: "This policy establishes the Code of Conduct and Ethics (\"Code\") of Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. The Code defines the ethical standards, behavioral expectations, legal obligations, and prohibited conduct applicable to every individual who works for or on behalf of the agency. The Code is a foundational element of the Corporate Compliance Program (CO-CP-001) and reflects the agency's commitment to conducting all operations with honesty, integrity, and respect for patients, employees, referral partners, and payers.\n\n---",
