        level: 2,
        order: 7,
        body: "6.1 All workforce members have an affirmative obligation to report suspected violations of this Code, applicable law, or agency policy.\n6.2 Reports may be made through any of the following mechanisms (per policy CO-CP-006):\nDirect contact with the Compliance Officer\nAgency compliance hotline (anonymous option available)\nDirect contact with the Governing Body Chair (for matters involving the Compliance Officer or Administrator)\n6.3 Reports may be made anonymously. Anonymous reports will be investigated to the extent practicable given the information provided.\n6.4 No individual will be retaliated against for making a good-faith compliance report, per policy CO-CP-005.\n\n---",
