        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.3.1 | Compliance Officer | Check the compliance hotline voicemail (or third-party hotline system) no less than once every business day. | Daily on business days. |\n| 6.3.2 | Compliance Officer | If a third-party hotline service is used, ensure the service meets the following requirements: (a) available 24/7; (b) anonymous option; (c) reports delivered to Compliance Officer within 24 hours; (d) Business Associate Agreement in place per CO-HP-005. | Prior to activation; reviewed annually. |\n| 6.3.3 | Compliance Officer | Test the hotline by conducting an anonymous test call at least quarterly to verify functionality. Document test results. | Quarterly. |\n\n---",
