        title: "Investigation Closure",
        level: 3,
        order: 12,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.5.1 | Compliance Officer | Prepare an Investigation Closure Memorandum (Appendix E) upon: (a) completion of investigation and CAP implementation; (b) determination of no further action required; (c) referral to external authority. | Within 7 days of CAP confirmation or determination of no action. |\n| 6.5.2 | Compliance Officer | Update the Compliance Report Log (CO-CP-006 Appendix A) with investigation outcome and closure date. | Within 1 business day of closure. |\n| 6.5.3 | Compliance Officer | Notify non-anonymous reporters of investigation closure and outcome (without disclosing confidential details) per CO-CP-006 Section 6.4. | Within 7 days of closure. |\n| 6.5.4 | Compliance Officer | Present investigation summary (without identifying details) to the Compliance Committee at the next regular meeting and to the Governing Body in the quarterly compliance report. | At next quarterly meeting. |\n\n---",
