        id: "5-policy-statement",
        title: "4\\. Policy Statement",
        level: 2,
        order: 5,
        body: "4.1 The agency shall maintain an active documentation audit program as a component of the internal compliance auditing program (CO-RA-002).\n4.2 Documentation audits shall use standardized scoring criteria and defined deficiency thresholds.\n4.3 Audit results shall be reported to the Compliance Committee and used to target training and corrective action.\n\n---",
