        order: 24,
        body: "| Citation | Relevance |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| 42 U.S.C. § 1320a-7b(b) | Anti-Kickback Statute. |\n| 42 U.S.C. § 1395nn | Stark Law (Physician Self-Referral). |\n| 42 CFR § 1001.952 | AKS Safe Harbors. |\n| 42 CFR §§ 411.350–411.389 | Stark Law Regulations and Exceptions. |\n| OIG Compliance Program Guidance for HHAs | AKS/Stark compliance is required element. |\n| CO-CP-001 | Corporate Compliance Program. |\n| CO-CP-004 | Code of Conduct (gift/kickback provisions). |\n| CO-CP-006 | Reporting mechanisms. |\n| CO-CP-007 | Investigation process. |\n\n## 10–11. Training & Version Control\nPer CO-CP-008 and EN-LC-001 standards.\n### Appendix A — Referral Source Relationship Registry\n\n| # | Referral Source Name | Entity Type | Financial Arrangement? | Arrangement Type | FMV Verified? | AKS Safe Harbor? | Stark Exception? | Last Review Date | Status |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 |  | ☐ Physician ☐ Hospital ☐ SNF ☐ Group ☐ Other | ☐ Yes ☐ No |  | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ N/A | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ N/A | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ N/A |  | ☐ Active ☐ Terminated |\n\n### Appendix B — Referral Arrangement Compliance Checklist\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Referral Source Name |  |\n| Arrangement Type | ☐ Lease ☐ Employment ☐ Consulting ☐ Service Agreement ☐ Other: |\n| Arrangement Description |  |\n\nAKS Analysis:\n\n| Question | Response |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Does the arrangement involve remuneration (anything of value)? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Could the remuneration induce or reward referrals? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Does the arrangement satisfy an AKS safe harbor? | ☐ Yes — Which: _______________ ☐ No ☐ N/A |\n| If no safe harbor: has legal counsel approved? | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ Pending |\n\nStark Analysis:\n\n| Question | Response |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Does the arrangement involve a physician (or physician family member)? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Does the physician refer Medicare patients to the agency? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Does the arrangement create a \"financial relationship\"? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n| Does the arrangement satisfy a Stark exception? | ☐ Yes — Which: _______________ ☐ No ☐ N/A |\n\nDetermination: ☐ Compliant — Approved for execution ☐ Non-Compliant — Do not execute ☐ Requires legal review\nCompliance Officer Signature: ________________________________ Date: _______________\n### Appendix C — Marketing Activity Log\n\n| Date | Referral Source | Contact Person | Activity Type | Description | Value ($) | Cumulative Annual Value to This Individual ($) | Exceeds Limit? |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n|  |  |  | ☐ Meal ☐ Gift ☐ Material ☐ Meeting ☐ Event |  | $ | $ | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n\nLimits: $25/occurrence | $50/year per individual\n### Appendix D — Policy Acknowledgment Form\n(Standard format — CO-FA-001 reference)\n\n---",
