        id: "24-references",
        title: "9\\. References",
        level: 2,
        order: 24,
        body: "| Citation | Relevance |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| 45 CFR Parts 160, 164 (Subparts A, E) | HIPAA Privacy Rule. |\n| CO-HP-002 through CO-HP-007 | Related HIPAA policies. |\n| CO-CP-001 | Corporate Compliance Program. |\n| CO-CP-008 | Compliance Training. |\n\n## 10–11. Training & Version Control\nPer CO-CP-008 and EN-LC-001 standards.\n### Appendix A — Notice of Privacy Practices (Summary Template)\n(Agency must customize per legal counsel review)\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. — NOTICE OF PRIVACY PRACTICES Effective Date: 2025-07-10\nTHIS NOTICE DESCRIBES HOW MEDICAL INFORMATION ABOUT YOU MAY BE USED AND DISCLOSED AND HOW YOU CAN GET ACCESS TO THIS INFORMATION. PLEASE REVIEW IT CAREFULLY.\nYour Rights: You have the right to: (1) request a copy of your health records; (2) request corrections to your records; (3) request confidential communications; (4) request restrictions on certain uses and disclosures; (5) receive an accounting of disclosures; (6) receive a paper copy of this notice; (7) file a complaint.\nOur Uses and Disclosures: We may use and disclose your PHI for: treatment, payment, healthcare operations, as required by law, and for other purposes permitted by law.\nOur Responsibilities: We are required to maintain the privacy of your PHI, provide this notice, and follow the terms of this notice.\nComplaints: Contact our Privacy Officer at [contact] or the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services at www.hhs.gov/ocr/privacy/hipaa/complaints.\n### Appendix B — NPP Acknowledgment of Receipt\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name |  |\n| Medical Record Number |  |\n\nI acknowledge that I have received a copy of the Notice of Privacy Practices of Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc.\n\n| Patient/Representative Signature |  |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Date |  |\n| If signed by representative — relationship to patient |  |\n| ☐ Patient refused to sign — Staff witness signature: |  |\n| Witness Date: |  |\n\n### Appendix C — Disclosure Tracking Log\n\n| # | Date of Disclosure | Patient Name/MRN | Recipient | Purpose | PHI Disclosed (description) | Authorization On File? | Disclosed By |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 |  |  |  |  |  | ☐ Yes ☐ No — Basis: |  |\n\n### Appendix D — Privacy Complaint Log\n\n| # | Date Received | Complainant | Nature of Complaint | Investigation # | Status | Outcome | Sanctions Applied? |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| PC-2025-001 |  | ☐ Patient ☐ Staff ☐ External |  |  | ☐ Open ☐ Closed | ☐ Substantiated ☐ Unsubstantiated | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n\n### Appendix E — Policy Acknowledgment Form\n(Standard format — CO-HP-001 reference)\n\n---",
