        title: "Breach Identification and Risk Assessment",
        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1.1 | Any workforce member | Report any suspected breach to the Privacy Officer immediately. | Immediately. |\n| 6.1.2 | Privacy Officer | Conduct a four-factor risk assessment per 45 CFR § 164.402: (a) nature and extent of PHI involved; (b) unauthorized person who used/accessed PHI; (c) whether PHI was actually acquired or viewed; (d) extent to which risk has been mitigated. Document using the Breach Risk Assessment Form (Appendix A). | Within 10 business days of report. |\n| 6.1.3 | Privacy Officer | Determine whether the incident constitutes a reportable breach or falls within an exception (unintentional access, inadvertent disclosure, good faith belief PHI not retained). | Within 10 business days. |\n\n---",
