        title: "4\\. Policy Statement",
        level: 2,
        order: 5,
        body: "4.1 The agency shall not disclose PHI to any business associate without a current, executed BAA.\n4.2 All BAAs shall contain the elements required by 45 CFR § 164.504(e)(2).\n4.3 The Compliance Officer shall maintain a BAA Registry and conduct annual review of all BAAs.\n4.4 Any business associate breach or non-compliance shall be addressed per the BAA terms and CO-HP-003.\n\n---",
