        title: "6\\. Procedures",
        level: 2,
        order: 7,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1 | Any staff member | Direct all patient record requests to the Privacy Officer. | Immediately upon receipt. |\n| 6.2 | Privacy Officer | Log the request in the Patient Records Request Log (Appendix A). | Within 1 business day. |\n| 6.3 | Privacy Officer | For access requests: provide records in the format requested (if readily producible) within 30 calendar days. One 30-day extension permitted with written notice to patient. | 30 calendar days; extension with notice. |\n| 6.4 | Privacy Officer | For amendment requests: evaluate and respond within 60 calendar days. Accept or deny with written explanation. If denied, inform patient of right to submit a statement of disagreement. | 60 calendar days. |\n| 6.5 | Privacy Officer | For accounting of disclosures: compile from Disclosure Tracking Log (CO-HP-001 Appendix C) and provide within 60 calendar days. | 60 calendar days. |\n\n### Appendix A — Patient Records Request Log\n\n| # | Date Received | Patient Name/MRN | Request Type | Description | Due Date | Date Fulfilled | Outcome | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| PRR-2025-001 |  |  | ☐ Access ☐ Amendment ☐ Accounting ☐ Restriction ☐ Confidential Communication |  |  |  | ☐ Granted ☐ Denied ☐ Partial |  |\n\n### Appendix B — Policy Acknowledgment Form\n(Standard format)\n\n---",
