        id: "3-purpose",
        title: "2\\. Purpose",
        level: 2,
        order: 3,
        body: "This policy establishes the comprehensive incident response and breach notification program for Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. covering the detection, classification, investigation, containment, remediation, breach determination, notification, and documentation of security incidents and breaches involving protected health information (PHI) and personally identifiable information (PII). This policy ensures compliance with the HIPAA Breach Notification Rule (45 CFR §§ 164.400–164.414), the HITECH Act (42 U.S.C. § 17932), California data breach notification law (Cal. Civ. Code § 1798.82), and the CMIA breach provisions (Cal. Civ. Code § 56.36).\n\n---",
