        level: 3,
        order: 9,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | Compliance Officer | Develop an annual mock survey schedule. Schedule must include: (a) one comprehensive mock survey annually using CMS SOM Appendix B survey protocol; (b) one focused mock survey per quarter targeting high-risk areas. | Approved at Q1 Compliance Committee meeting. |\n| 6.2.2 | Compliance Officer | Conduct or commission each mock survey per the schedule. For comprehensive mock surveys: utilize an external consultant or cross-trained internal team that did not create the documentation being reviewed. | Per annual schedule. |\n| 6.2.3 | Compliance Officer | Document all mock survey findings using the Mock Survey Findings Report (Appendix B). Findings shall mirror actual survey reporting format: identify the regulation cited, the finding, and the evidence. | Within 14 calendar days of mock survey completion. |\n| 6.2.4 | Compliance Officer | For High-severity mock survey findings: develop corrective action per QA-AE-003 within 14 calendar days. For Moderate findings: develop corrective action within 30 calendar days. | Per severity. |\n| 6.2.5 | Compliance Officer | Present mock survey results at the next Compliance Committee meeting and include summary in the quarterly Governing Body compliance report. | At next Compliance Committee meeting; quarterly to Governing Body. |\n\n---",
