        level: 3,
        order: 10,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.3.1 | Compliance Officer | Develop and maintain Survey Interaction Guidelines (Appendix C) covering: (a) immediate surveyor notification chain; (b) badge and identification verification; (c) interview demeanor and response standards; (d) documentation provision protocols; (e) prohibited behaviors (arguing, volunteering information, destroying documents). | Maintained continuously; updated annually. |\n| 6.3.2 | Compliance Officer | Include survey interaction training in compliance orientation (CO-CP-008) and annual refresher training for all workforce members. | At hire; annually. |\n| 6.3.3 | Administrator | Conduct a survey readiness drill at least once annually — unannounced to staff — simulating surveyor arrival, notification chain activation, and initial document request. Document results and identified gaps. | Annually. |\n\n---",
