        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1.1 | Compliance Officer | Develop and maintain the CoP Compliance Matrix (Appendix A) mapping all applicable Conditions and Standards to: (a) the implementing agency policy; (b) the responsible party; (c) the monitoring mechanism; (d) the evidence of compliance. | Maintained continuously; reviewed annually at Q1. |\n| 6.1.2 | Compliance Officer | Update the Matrix within 30 calendar days of any regulatory change affecting CoP requirements, per CO-RA-001. | Within 30 calendar days of regulatory change. |\n| 6.1.3 | Compliance Officer | Distribute the current Matrix to all department heads annually and upon any substantive update. | Annually; upon update. |\n\n---",
