        body: "| Field | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Policy ID | FN-BC-001 |\n| Title | Medicare Billing & Claims Submission |\n| Domain | FN — Finance & Revenue Cycle |\n| Subdomain | BC — Billing & Claims |\n| Version | 6.0 |\n| Effective Date | 2025-07-10 |\n| Status | ACTIVE |\n| Classification Tier | REQUIRED |\n| Review Cycle | Annual |\n| Next Review Date | 2026-07-10 |\n| Last Reviewed | 2025-07-10 |\n| Policy Owner/Steward | CFO / Revenue Cycle Director |\n| Access Tier | Tier 3 — Confidential |\n| Approved By | Governing Body Chair — Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. |\n| Supersedes | N/A (Initial Version) |\n| Regulatory Alignment | 42 CFR Part 424, 42 CFR § 484.50, CMS IOM Pub. 100-04 Ch. 10, False Claims Act 31 U.S.C. §§ 3729–3733, HIPAA 837 Transaction Standards (45 CFR Parts 160/162), ACA § 1128J(d) (60-Day Rule) |\n\n---",
