        body: "| Compliance Indicator | Measurement Method | Acceptable Standard |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Claims submitted within timely filing deadline | Review of claims submission log and timely filing calendar; zero expired claims | 100% |\n| Clean claim rate (accepted on first electronic submission) | Clearinghouse acceptance report; 999/277CA confirmations | ≥ 95% |\n| Denial rate | Monthly denial analysis per FN-BC-002 | ≤ 5% |\n| Pre-Billing Verification Checklist completed for all 30-day periods | Audit of completed Appendix A checklists against total episodes billed | 100% |\n| All billing holds resolved within 14 calendar days | Billing Hold Log review | 100% within 14 calendar days |\n| Billing staff annual training completion | HR training records | 100% |\n| Policy acknowledgment current for all in-scope personnel | Appendix D file review | 100% within 14 calendar days of effective date |\n| No claims submitted for services not rendered | Triangulation audit per CO-DC-004 | Zero findings |\n| All identified overpayments refunded within 60 days | Overpayment tracking log per FN-BC-004 | 100% |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "lesson",
