        title: "3\\. Scope",
        level: 2,
        order: 4,
        body: "This policy applies to:\nCFO / Revenue Cycle Director\nAll billing coordinators and billing specialists\nAll certified coders\nDirector of Nursing / Clinical Manager (for clinical denial review)\nCompliance Officer (for denial pattern analysis and compliance correlation)\nAdministrator\nQAPI Coordinator (for denial trending integration with quality program)\nAny contracted billing service performing denial management functions\nThis policy does not apply to:\nNon-Medicare denials from commercial payers or Medicare Advantage plans are managed using similar principles but may have different appeal timelines and processes. Revenue Cycle Director shall maintain payer-specific appeal protocols for non-Medicare payers.\n\n---",
