        title: "1\\. Policy Header",
        level: 2,
        order: 2,
        body: "| Field | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Policy ID | FN-BC-003 |\n| Title | Patient Billing & Financial Responsibility |\n| Domain | FN — Finance & Revenue Cycle |\n| Subdomain | BC — Billing & Claims |\n| Version | 6.0 |\n| Effective Date | 2025-07-10 |\n| Status | ACTIVE |\n| Classification Tier | REQUIRED |\n| Review Cycle | Annual |\n| Next Review Date | 2026-07-10 |\n| Last Reviewed | 2025-07-10 |\n| Policy Owner/Steward | CFO / Revenue Cycle Director |\n| Access Tier | Tier 3 — Confidential |\n| Approved By | Governing Body Chair — Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. |\n| Supersedes | N/A (Initial Version) |\n| Regulatory Alignment | 42 CFR § 484.50 (Patient Rights — Financial Information), 42 CFR § 489.20 (Provider Agreements), CMS ABN Requirements (CMS-R-131), Fair Debt Collection Practices Act (15 U.S.C. § 1692), No Surprises Act (where applicable), HIPAA Privacy Rule (45 CFR § 164.502) |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
