        body: "10.1 All intake coordinators and billing staff shall receive training on this policy within 14 calendar days of hire or assignment. Training shall cover: (a) patient financial responsibility notification requirements; (b) ABN issuance criteria, process, and prohibitions; (c) NOMNC requirements; (d) billing statement standards; (e) billing dispute handling; (f) collection process and FDCPA requirements; (g) charity care screening obligation.\n10.2 Annual refresher training on ABN requirements and current CMS ABN form.\n10.3 All in-scope personnel shall sign Appendix E within 14 calendar days.\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
