        order: 2,
        body: "| Field | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Policy ID | FN-BC-004__ |\n| Title | Overpayment Identification & Refund |\n| Domain | FN — Finance & Revenue Cycle |\n| Subdomain | BC — Billing & Claims__ |\n| Version | 6.0 |\n| Effective Date | 2025-07-10 |\n| Status | ACTIVE |\n| Classification Tier | REQUIRED |\n| Review Cycle | Annual |\n| Next Review Date | 2026-07-10 |\n| Last Reviewed | 2025-07-10__ |\n| Policy Owner/Steward | CFO / Revenue Cycle Director |\n| Access Tier | Tier 3 — Confidential |\n| Approved By | Governing Body Chair — Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. |\n| Supersedes | N/A (Initial Version) |\n| Regulatory Alignment | 42 U.S.C. § 1320a-7k(d) (ACA 60-Day Rule), 42 CFR § 401.305 (Reporting and Returning Overpayments), False Claims Act 31 U.S.C. §§ 3729–3733, OIG Compliance Program Guidance, CMS Self-Referral Disclosure Protocol |\n\n---",
