        body: "Per EN-LC-001. Substantive revisions require CFO review and Governing Body approval. Re-acknowledgment within 14 calendar days.\n## Appendix A — NOA Submission Tracking Log\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. NOA Submission Tracking Log Policy Reference: FN-BC-006 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nInstructions: Log every NOA. Revenue Cycle Director reviews daily. Retained 7 years.\n\n| # | Patient Name | Medicare # | Episode Type | SOC/ROC Date | NOA Submission Date | Days SOC to NOA | Timely (≤5 days)? | Clearinghouse Ack Date | MAC Accept Date | Rejected? | Rejection Reason | Resubmission Date | Final Accept Date | Late NOA? | Payment Reduction (est.) | Missed NOA? | Root Cause (if late/missed) | Corrective Action | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 |  |  | ☐SOC ☐ROC |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N | $ | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  |\n| 2 |  |  | ☐SOC ☐ROC |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N | $ | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  |\n| 3 |  |  | ☐SOC ☐ROC |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  | ☐Y☐N | $ | ☐Y☐N |  |  |  |\n\nMonthly Summary:\n\n| Metric | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Total NOAs Submitted |  |\n| Timely NOAs (≤5 days) | ( %) |\n| Late NOAs (6–30 days) | ( %) |\n| Missed NOAs (>30 days) |  |\n| Total Payment Reduction from Late NOAs | $ |\n| Total Revenue Lost from Missed NOAs | $ |\n| Average Days from SOC to NOA Submission |  |\n\nRevenue Cycle Director Daily Review: _________________________ Date: _________\n## Appendix B — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Policy Acknowledgment Form Policy Reference: FN-BC-006 — NOA Management | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy FN-BC-006 — Request for Anticipated Payment (RAP) / Notice of Admission (NOA) Management, Version 6.0, effective 2025-07-10.\nI understand that a Notice of Admission must be submitted to Medicare within 5 calendar days of every SOC and ROC date.\nI understand that late NOA submission results in a payment reduction and that failure to submit an NOA within 30 days results in permanent loss of payment for the first 30-day period.\nI understand my role-specific obligations under this policy.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions.\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) | _________________________ |\n| Title / Role | _________________________ |\n| Signature | _________________________ |\n| Date Signed | _________________________ |\n\nAdministrative Use: Collected by _________________________ Date _________ Filed ☐ Yes\nI need to continue with the remaining 13 policies (FN-BC-007, FN-CM-001 through FN-CM-005, and FN-FP-001 through FN-FP-007). Given the extreme volume, let me continue in subsequent messages. This is installment 1 of the complete FN domain draft.\n\n---",
