        order: 30,
        body: "Per EN-LC-001. Substantive revisions require CFO review and Governing Body approval. Re-acknowledgment within 14 calendar days.\n## Appendix A — Payment Reconciliation Worksheet\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Payment Reconciliation Worksheet Policy Reference: FN-BC-007 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nInstructions: Complete for every paid Medicare claim within 30 calendar days of remittance receipt. Retained 7 years.\nCLAIM INFORMATION\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name | _________________________ |\n| Medicare Number | _________________________ |\n| 30-Day Period Dates | _________________________ |\n| Claim Control Number | _________________________ |\n| Remittance Advice Date | _________________________ |\n| Remittance Transaction # | _________________________ |\n\nPDGM CLASSIFICATION\n\n| Element | Billed | MAC Determination (per 835) | Match? |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Clinical Grouping | _____________ | _____________ | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Functional Level | _____________ | _____________ | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Comorbidity Adjustment | _____________ | _____________ | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Admission Source | ☐Institutional ☐Community | ☐Institutional ☐Community | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Timing | ☐Early ☐Late | ☐Early ☐Late | ☐Y ☐N |\n| HIPPS Code | _____________ | _____________ | ☐Y ☐N |\n\nPAYMENT CALCULATION\n\n| Element | Amount |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| A. Base Payment Rate (current CMS rate) | $ ________________ |\n| B. Case-Mix Weight | ________________ |\n| C. Wage Index (agency CBSA) | ________________ |\n| D. Expected PDGM Payment (A × B × wage adjustment) | $ ________________ |\n| E. Sequestration Reduction ( ___% ) | ($ ______________) |\n| F. Expected Payment After Sequestration (D - E) | $ ________________ |\n| G. LUPA Adjustment (if applicable — per-visit rate × visits__ | $ ________________ |\n| H. PEP Adjustment (if applicable) | $ ________________ |\n| I. Outlier Payment (if applicable) | $ ________________ |\n| J. Final Expected Payment | $ ________________ |\n\nACTUAL PAYMENT\n\n| Element | Amount |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| K. Actual Payment per 835 | $ ________________ |\n| L. Adjustments per 835 (describe): _____________ | $ ________________ |\n| M. Offsets per 835 (describe): _____________ | $ ________________ |\n| N. Net Actual Payment (K + I - L - M or as applicable) | $ ________________ |\n\nVARIANCE\n\n| Element | Amount |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| O. Payment Variance (N - J__ | $ ________________ |\n| P. Variance Percentage (O ÷ J × 100) | ______________% |\n| Q. Variance Status | ☐ Reconciled (≤$100) ☐ Investigation Required (>$100) |\n\nVARIANCE INVESTIGATION (if applicable)\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Investigation Date | _________________________ |\n| Investigator | _________________________ |\n| Variance Cause Identified | ☐ Correct CMS adjustment ☐ MAC processing error ☐ Agency coding error ☐ Duplicate payment ☐ LUPA applied ☐ PEP applied ☐ Outlier ☐ Offset ☐ Other: _______ |\n| Explanation | _________________________ |\n| Action Required | ☐ None — reconciled ☐ MAC inquiry filed ☐ Appeal per FN-BC-002 ☐ Replacement claim ☐ Overpayment reported per FN-BC-004 ☐ Other: _______ |\n| Action Date | _________________________ |\n| Resolution Date | _________________________ |\n| Final Status | ☐ Reconciled ☐ Pending |\n\nRevenue Cycle Director Review: _________________________ Date: _________\n## Appendix B — Monthly Payment Reconciliation Summary Report\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Monthly Payment Reconciliation Summary Report Policy Reference: FN-BC-007 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nReporting Month/Year: _____________ Prepared By: _____________ Date: _____________\nSECTION 1 — RECONCILIATION COMPLETION\n\n| Metric | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Total Claims Paid This Month |  |\n| Claims Reconciled (Appendix A completed__ |  |\n| Reconciliation Completion Rate | %__ |\n| Claims Pending Reconciliation | __ |\n\nSECTION 2 — PAYMENT SUMMARY\n\n| Metric | This Month | Prior Month | 3-Month Avg | Trend |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Total Expected Payment | $ | $ | $ |  |\n| Total Actual Payment | $ | $ | $ |  |\n| Total Net Variance | $ | $ | $ | __ |\n| Variance as % of Expected | % | % | % |  |\n\nSECTION 3 — VARIANCE ANALYSIS\n\n| Variance Category | Count | Dollar Amount | % of Total Variance |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Correct CMS adjustments (sequestration, LUPA, PEP, outlier) |  | $ | %__ |\n| Underpayments — MAC error |  | $ | % |\n| Underpayments — Agency billing/coding error |  | $ | % |\n| Overpayments identified |  | $ | % |\n| Offsets applied |  | $ | % |\n| Other |  | $ | % |\n| TOTAL VARIANCES INVESTIGATED |  | $ | 100% |\n\nSECTION 4 — ACTION ITEMS\n\n| Action | Count | Dollar Amount | Status |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| MAC inquiries filed for underpayment |  | $ |  |\n| Appeals filed per FN-BC-002 |  | $ |  |\n| Replacement claims submitted |  | $ |  |\n| Overpayments referred to Compliance Officer per FN-BC-004 |  | $ |  |\n| Open variances pending investigation |  | $ |  |\n\nSECTION 5 — CERTIFICATION\n\n|  | Signature | Date |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Revenue Cycle Director | _________________________ | _________ |\n| CFO Review | _________________________ | _________ |\n\nGoverning Body Quarterly Report: ☐ Q1 ☐ Q2 ☐ Q3 ☐ Q4 Date Submitted: _________\n## Appendix C — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Policy Acknowledgment Form Policy Reference: FN-BC-007 — Payment & Reimbursement Reconciliation | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy FN-BC-007 — Payment & Reimbursement Reconciliation, Version 6.0, effective 2025-07-10.\nI understand that every Medicare payment must be reconciled against expected PDGM reimbursement within 30 calendar days of remittance receipt.\nI understand that any identified overpayment must be reported to the Compliance Officer within 24 hours per FN-BC-004.\nI understand my role-specific obligations under this policy.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions.\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed__ | _________________________ |\n| Title / Role | _________________________ |\n| Signature | _________________________ |\n| Date Signed | _________________________ |\n\nAdministrative Use: Collected by _________________________ Date _________ Filed ☐ Yes\n\n---",
