        body: "Per EN-LC-001. Substantive revisions require CFO and Compliance Officer review, Governing Body approval, and re-acknowledgment within 14 calendar days.\n## Appendix A — Diagnosis Coding Worksheet\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Diagnosis Coding Worksheet Policy Reference: FN-CM-002 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name | _________________________ |\n| Medicare Number | _________________________ |\n| Episode Dates | _________________________ |\n| Assessment Type | ☐ SOC ☐ ROC ☐ Recert ☐ DC |\n| Coder | _________________________ |\n| Date Coded | _________________________ |\n\n\n| Seq | ICD-10-CM Code | Description | Physician Documented? | Documentation Source | Highest Specificity? | Actively Addressed? | PDGM Impact |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| M1021 (Principal) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N — Query # __ | ☐ 485 ☐ H&P ☐ DC Summary ☐ Progress Note ☐ Other | ☐Y ☐N | ☐__ | Clinical Group: _______ |\n| M1023 (Sec 1) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N |  | ☐Y ☐N | ☐Y ☐N | Comorbidity: ☐Y ☐N |\n| M1023 (Sec 2) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N |  | ☐Y ☐N | ☐Y ☐N | Comorbidity: ☐Y ☐N |\n| M1023 (Sec 3) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N |  | ☐Y ☐N | ☐Y ☐N | Comorbidity: ☐Y ☐N |\n| M1023 (Sec 4) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N |  | ☐Y ☐N | ☐Y ☐N | Comorbidity: ☐Y ☐N |\n| M1023 (Sec 5) |  |  | ☐Y ☐N |  | ☐Y ☐N | ☐Y ☐N | Comorbidity: ☐Y ☐N |\n\nCoder Certification: I certify that all codes are assigned per ICD-10-CM Official Guidelines and supported by physician documentation.\nCoder Signature: _________________________ Date: _________\n## Appendix B — Physician Query Form\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Physician Diagnosis Query Form Policy Reference: FN-CM-002 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name | _________________________ |\n| Date of Query | _________________________ |\n| Coder Name | _________________________ |\n| Physician Name | _________________________ |\n\nClinical Documentation Reference: The following documentation has been reviewed: _________________________\nQuery: Based on your clinical documentation, clarification is needed regarding the following:\nThis query does NOT suggest a specific diagnosis. Please document your clinical determination.\n☐ Is the condition best described as: (a) _____________ or (b) _____________ ? ☐ Please clarify the type/laterality/stage of: _____________ ☐ Is _____________ a current active condition being treated during this episode? ☐ Other: _____________\nPhysician Response:\nPhysician Signature: _________________________ Date: _________\nCoder Action Based on Response: Code Assigned: _____________ Rationale: _____________\nCoder Signature: _________________________ Date: _________\n## Appendix C — Quarterly Coding Accuracy Audit Report\n(Structure identical to FN-CM-001 Appendix B — adapted for ICD-10 coding accuracy metrics)\nCARE INDEED HOME HEALTH CARE, INC. Quarterly ICD-10 Coding Accuracy Audit Report Policy Reference: FN-CM-002 | Version: 6.0 | Effective: 2025-07-10\nQuarter: ☐ Q1 ☐ Q2 ☐ Q3 ☐ Q4 Year: _________ Audit Lead: _________________________ Date: _________\n\n| Metric | Episodes Reviewed | Correct | Incorrect | Accuracy | Target | Pass? |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Principal Diagnosis Accuracy |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Principal Diagnosis Specificity |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Secondary Diagnosis Accuracy |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Secondary Diagnosis Specificity |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Sequencing Compliance |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Physician Documentation Support |  |  |  | % | 100% | ☐Y ☐N |\n| Overall Coding Accuracy |  |  |  | % | ≥95% | ☐Y ☐N |\n\nIndividual Coder Performance:\n\n| Coder Name | Credential | Episodes Reviewed | Accuracy | Target (≥90%) | Pass? | Action Required? |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n|  |  |  | % | 90% | ☐Y ☐N |  |\n|  |  |  | % | 90% | ☐Y ☐N |  |\n\nFinancial Impact of Coding Errors: Overpayments: $_______ Underpayments: $_______ Net: $_______\nOverpayments referred to Compliance Officer: ☐ Yes Date: _________\nCertified: Audit Lead _____________ CFO _____________ Compliance Officer _____________ Date: _________\n## Appendix D — Policy Acknowledgment Form\n(Standard format — FN-CM-002 specific acknowledgment with coding accuracy and anti-upcoding attestation)\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy FN-CM-002 — ICD-10 Coding Standards & Accuracy, Version 6.0.\nI understand all codes must be supported by physician documentation and coded to the highest specificity.\nI understand that assigning codes to maximize payment rather than reflect documented conditions is prohibited and constitutes fraud.\nI understand my obligation to query physicians when documentation is insufficient.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions.\n\n| Full Name | Title | Signature | Date |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n|  |  |  |  |\n\nAdministrative Use: Collected by _____________ Date _________ Filed ☐ Yes\n\n---",
