        body: "- 42 CFR § 484.105 — Governing Body financial oversight.\n- OIG Compliance Program Guidance for Home Health Agencies — procurement integrity.\n- CMS Provider Reimbursement Manual cost-allocation principles.\n\n### 9.1 Cross-Referenced Agency Policies\n- FN-FP-005 — Annual Budget & Financial Planning.\n- FN-FP-007 — Financial Compliance & Fraud Monitoring Controls.\n- HR-TA-003 — OIG/SAM Exclusion Screening.\n- CO-HP-007 — Record Retention & Destruction.\n- GV-GB-001 — Governing Body Authority & Responsibilities.\n- EN-TG-001 — Enterprise Policy Taxonomy & Classification Governance.\n\n---",
