        title: "APPENDICES",
        level: 2,
        order: 31,
        body: "### Appendix A — Closure/CHOW Master Transition Checklist\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: GV-EA-005 | Version: 1.0 | Date: 2025-07-10\nPurpose: To provide a comprehensive checklist for tracking all required activities during an agency closure, change of ownership, or merger, ensuring no regulatory, patient care, workforce, financial, or record management obligation is missed.\nInstructions: The Administrator shall use this checklist as the master tracking tool for the transition. Update status weekly. Present the checklist to the Governing Body at each meeting during the transition period.\nEvent Type: ☐ Planned Closure ☐ Change of Ownership ☐ Merger ☐ Involuntary Closure\nGoverning Body Authorization Date: _____________ Target Effective Date: _____________\n#### Section 1 — Governance and Legal\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1.1 | Governing Body decision documented in meeting minutes | Designated Secretary | At decision meeting | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 1.2 | Legal Counsel engaged | Administrator | Within 3 days of decision | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 1.3 | Transition Team established and meeting weekly | Administrator | Within 7 days of decision | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n\n#### Section 2 — Regulatory Notifications\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 2.1 | CMS MAC notified (CMS-855A filed) | Administrator | 90 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 2.2 | HCAI notified | Administrator | Per HCAI requirements | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 2.3 | State survey agency notified | Administrator | Concurrent with MAC | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 2.4 | DHCS/Medi-Cal notified (if applicable) | Administrator | 30 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n| 2.5 | Accrediting organization notified (if applicable) | Administrator | 30 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n\n#### Section 3 — Patient Notification and Transition\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 3.1 | Complete patient census compiled | Director of Nursing | Within 7 days of decision | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.2 | Patient/caregiver notification letters sent | Director of Nursing | 30 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.3 | Individualized Patient Transition Plans completed | Director of Nursing | 14 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.4 | Attending physicians notified | Director of Nursing | 14 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.5 | Clinical transfers completed for all patients | Assigned Clinicians | Before last date of service | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.6 | OASIS transfer/discharge assessments completed and transmitted | Director of Nursing | Before last date of service | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 3.7 | All patients confirmed safely transitioned or discharged | Director of Nursing | Before last date of service | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n\n#### Section 4 — Employee Notification and Workforce Transition\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 4.1 | WARN Act applicability assessed | HR Director | At time of decision | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n| 4.2 | Employee notification letters distributed | HR Director | 60 days before closure (if WARN applies) | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 4.3 | Separation processing completed for all employees | HR Director | At closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 4.4 | Final paychecks issued per California law | HR Director | Per California law | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 4.5 | COBRA notices issued | HR Director | Per COBRA requirements | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 4.6 | System access revoked for all separated employees | IT Director | At or before separation | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n\n#### Section 5 — Financial Closeout\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 5.1 | All outstanding claims submitted | CFO | Before closure/run-out | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.2 | All OASIS submissions completed | CFO / Director of Nursing | Before last date of service | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.3 | A/R and A/P reconciled | CFO | Within 60 days of closure | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.4 | Overpayments identified and refunded | CFO | Per CMS 60-day rule | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.5 | Payer contracts cancelled or transferred | CFO | 30 days before effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.6 | Vendor contracts settled | Administrator | Before closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.7 | Insurance resolved; tail coverage arranged | Administrator | Before closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 5.8 | Final financial report to Governing Body | CFO | Within 30 days of closure | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n\n#### Section 6 — Records and Credentials\n\n| # | Task | Responsible Party | Deadline | Status | Date Completed | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1 | Records custodian designated | Administrator | Before closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 6.2 | Record Transfer Agreement executed (CHOW) | Administrator / Legal Counsel | Before CHOW effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n| 6.3 | Patients notified of post-closure records access | Director of Nursing | Before closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 6.4 | Electronic systems archived and decommissioned | IT Director | At closure date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 6.5 | California license surrendered to HCAI | Administrator | After patient transitions | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 6.6 | Medicare termination confirmed with CMS MAC | Administrator | At effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n| 6.7 | Medi-Cal disenrollment confirmed (if applicable) | Administrator | At effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n| 6.8 | Accreditation surrendered (if applicable) | Administrator | At effective date | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending ☐ N/A |  |  |\n| 6.9 | Agency Credential Register updated | Administrator | Within 7 days of each surrender | ☐ Complete ☐ Pending |  |  |\n\nChecklist Maintained By: _________________________ Title: _________________________\nDate Last Updated: _____________\nPresented to Governing Body: ☐ Meeting Date: _____________ ☐ Meeting Date: _____________ ☐ Meeting Date: _____________\n### Appendix B — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: GV-EA-005 | Version: 1.0\nACKNOWLEDGMENT\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy GV-EA-005 — Agency Closure or Change of Ownership, Version 1.0, effective 2025-07-10.\nI understand the closure, change of ownership, and transition requirements described in this policy as they apply to my role at Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc.\nI understand that patient safety and continuity of care are the paramount priorities in any closure or ownership transition and that patient abandonment is prohibited.\nI understand that I am accountable for complying with this policy and that non-compliance may result in corrective action.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions and receive clarification regarding any aspect of this policy.\n\n| Field | Response |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) |  |\n| Title / Role |  |\n| Signature |  |\n| Date Signed |  |\n\nCollected By: _________________________ Date Filed: _____________\n\n---",
