        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1.1 | Administrator / Governing Body Chair | At the time of appointment or onboarding of any individual within the scope of this policy, provide the individual with: (a) a copy of this policy GV-GB-003; (b) a blank Conflict of Interest Disclosure Form (Appendix A); (c) a verbal or written explanation of the disclosure requirements, recusal obligations, and consequences of non-disclosure. | At the time of appointment; no later than the individual's first day in their governance role. |\n| 6.1.2 | Newly Appointed Individual | Complete and sign the Conflict of Interest Disclosure Form in full. All sections must be completed — no section may be left blank. If no conflict exists in a given category, the individual shall affirmatively mark \"None\" or \"No.\" | Completed and submitted to the Compliance Officer within 7 calendar days of appointment. |\n| 6.1.3 | Compliance Officer | Receive and log the disclosure form in the conflict of interest tracking log (Appendix C). Assign a unique disclosure reference number. | Within 3 calendar days of receipt. |\n| 6.1.4 | Compliance Officer | Review the disclosure for completeness. If any section is incomplete or ambiguous, return the form to the individual with written instructions for correction within 5 calendar days of receipt. | Within 5 calendar days of receipt. |\n| 6.1.5 | Compliance Officer | Assess each disclosed item for materiality and conflict risk using the criteria in Section 6.4. Prepare a written review memo documenting: (a) each disclosed item; (b) materiality assessment; (c) recommended management action. | Within 14 calendar days of receiving a complete disclosure. |\n| 6.1.6 | Compliance Officer | Present the review memo to the Governing Body at the next regular or special meeting. If the appointment occurs between meetings and the conflict is assessed as material, the Compliance Officer shall request a special meeting or secure written Governing Body concurrence within 14 calendar days of the disclosure review. | Presented at the next Governing Body meeting; material conflicts actioned within 14 calendar days of review. |\n\n---",
