        body: "### 9.1 Federal Regulations\n\n| Citation | Title | Relevance |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 42 CFR § 484.105 | Condition of Participation: Organization and Administration of Services | Primary regulatory framework for governing body functioning; self-assessment supports evidence of active governance. |\n| 42 CFR § 484.65 | Condition of Participation: Quality Assessment and Performance Improvement | Governing body oversight of QAPI is a primary self-assessment domain; gaps identified in QAPI oversight may trigger corrective action under this regulation. |\n\n### 9.2 OIG Guidance\n\n| Document | Relevance |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| OIG Compliance Program Guidance for Home Health Agencies (1998; supplemented) | Identifies governing body engagement with the compliance program as a core compliance program element; self-assessment is a mechanism for demonstrating that engagement. |\n| OIG General Compliance Program Guidance (2023) | Reinforces the expectation that governing bodies actively assess and improve their compliance oversight functions. |\n\n### 9.3 Cross-Referenced Agency Policies\n\n| Policy ID | Policy Title | Relationship to GV-GB-005 |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| GV-GB-001 | Governing Body Authority & Responsibilities | Parent governance policy; references annual self-assessment as a required governance activity. |\n| GV-GB-002 | Board Meeting & Minutes Requirements | Q1 meeting minutes document the self-assessment per this policy. |\n| GV-GB-003 | Conflict of Interest Disclosure | Conflict of interest management is a self-assessment domain; gaps identified may require action under GV-GB-003. |\n| GV-GB-004 | Succession Planning for Key Leadership | Succession planning adequacy is a self-assessment domain. |\n| GV-PM-003 | Policy Acknowledgment & Staff Attestation | Acknowledgment required for this policy by all Governing Body members. |\n| CO-CP-001 | Corporate Compliance Program | Governing body oversight of compliance is a primary self-assessment domain. |\n| QA-PG-001 | QAPI Program Establishment & Governance | Governing body QAPI oversight is a primary self-assessment domain. |\n| QA-AE-003 | Corrective Action Plan Development & Tracking | Critical compliance gaps identified in the self-assessment may trigger corrective action under this policy. |\n| EN-TG-001 | Enterprise Policy Taxonomy & Classification Governance | Framework under which this policy is classified. |\n| EN-LC-001 | Policy Lifecycle Management & Version Control | Policy version control and lifecycle management for this policy. |\n\n---",
