        id: "31-appendices",
        title: "APPENDICES",
        level: 2,
        order: 31,
        body: "### Appendix A — Organizational Chart Template\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: GV-OG-001 | Version: 6.0 | Date: 2025-07-10\nPurpose: To provide a standardized format for the agency's organizational chart that satisfies CMS surveyor expectations and clearly depicts all required reporting relationships.\nInstructions: The Administrator shall use this template to develop and maintain the agency's organizational chart. The chart must be updated within 14 calendar days of any change and approved by the Governing Body annually and upon material changes. Solid lines indicate direct supervisory authority. Dashed lines indicate advisory, coordination, or dual-reporting relationships.\nREQUIRED ELEMENTS ON ORGANIZATIONAL CHART:\n\n| Element | Requirement |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Governing Body | Depicted at the top of the hierarchy with name/title of Chair. |\n| Administrator | Solid line reporting to Governing Body. |\n| Director of Nursing / Clinical Manager | Solid line reporting to Administrator; notation of authority over all clinical operations. |\n| Compliance Officer | Solid line to Administrator for administrative reporting; dashed line to Governing Body for compliance reporting. |\n| Clinical Departments | All clinical disciplines (nursing, PT, OT, SLP, MSW, HHA) with reporting lines to Director of Nursing. |\n| Administrative Departments | All administrative departments (HR, Finance, Operations, IT) with reporting lines to Administrator or designated department head. |\n| Branch Offices (if applicable) | Branch supervisors with solid line reporting to central office leadership. |\n| Contracted / Outsourced Functions | Labeled as \"Contracted\" with dashed line to supervising agency leader. |\n| Chart Metadata | Agency name, effective date, version, approval date, approving authority. |\n\nChart Prepared By: _______________________ Title: _______________________\nDate Prepared: _____________ Approved By (Governing Body): _______________________ Date Approved: _____________\n### Appendix B — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: GV-OG-001 | Version: 6.0\nPurpose: To document that all individuals within the scope of this policy have received, read, and understand their obligations under GV-OG-001 — Organizational Structure & Reporting, as required by policy GV-PM-003.\nInstructions: Each individual within the scope of this policy must sign this form within 14 calendar days of the policy effective date, any policy revision, or new hire/appointment. The Administrator shall collect all signed forms and maintain them in the policy acknowledgment file. Failure to acknowledge within the required timeframe shall be escalated per Section 10.3.\nACKNOWLEDGMENT\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy GV-OG-001 — Organizational Structure & Reporting, Version 6.0, effective 2025-07-10.\nI understand the organizational structure, reporting relationships, and lines of authority described in this policy as they apply to my role at Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc.\nI understand who my direct supervisor is and my chain of command for escalation purposes.\nI understand that I am accountable for complying with this policy and that non-compliance may result in corrective action.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions and receive clarification regarding any aspect of this policy.\n\n| Field | Response |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) |  |\n| Title / Role |  |\n| Direct Supervisor Name |  |\n| Signature |  |\n| Date Signed |  |\n\nCollected By: _________________________ Date Filed: _____________\n### Appendix C — Annual Organizational Structure Review Checklist\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: GV-OG-001 | Version: 6.0\nPurpose: To provide the Administrator with a structured checklist for conducting the annual organizational structure review required by Section 6.3.\nInstructions: The Administrator shall complete this checklist annually prior to presenting the organizational structure review to the Governing Body at the first quarterly meeting. Any item marked \"No\" must include an explanation and a corrective action plan.\nCalendar Year Under Review: ___________\n\n| # | Review Item | Yes / No | Evidence / Notes | Corrective Action (if No) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | Current organizational chart exists and is dated within the past 12 months? |  |  |  |\n| 2 | Organizational chart has been approved by the Governing Body (documented in minutes)? |  |  |  |\n| 3 | All required positions are filled (Administrator, Director of Nursing, Compliance Officer)? |  |  |  |\n| 4 | Reporting lines on the chart match job descriptions for all positions? |  |  |  |\n| 5 | Compliance Officer has a documented dual-reporting line (Administrator + Governing Body)? |  |  |  |\n| 6 | Organizational structure supports all services within the defined scope of services (GV-OG-003)? |  |  |  |\n| 7 | Staffing levels are adequate for each department and position (per HR-WM-001)? |  |  |  |\n| 8 | All branch offices (if applicable) have defined reporting lines to central office? |  |  |  |\n| 9 | All structural changes since last review have been documented and communicated? |  |  |  |\n| 10 | Organizational chart is accessible to all agency personnel? |  |  |  |\n| 11 | Organizational chart was reviewed with new employees during orientation (verified with HR)? |  |  |  |\n| 12 | No staff reported confusion about their reporting relationships (based on HR feedback, grievances, or survey data)? |  |  |  |\n\nCompleted By: _________________________ Title: _________________________\nDate: _____________ Presented to Governing Body: ☐ Yes — Date: _____________\n# Policy 2 of 7: GV-OG-002\n# Administrator Qualifications & Responsibilities\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
