        order: 29,
        body: "10.1 All staff shall receive training on this policy during new employee orientation, including the grievance intake process, logging requirements, escalation triggers, and non-retaliation obligations.\n10.2 Clinical staff shall receive specific training on informing patients and families of their right to file a grievance and providing contact information for the Grievance Coordinator.\n10.3 Annual refresher training on grievance handling shall be included in the agency's mandatory training program per policy HR-TD-001.\n10.4 All individuals within scope shall acknowledge this policy within 14 calendar days of hire or appointment, and within 14 calendar days of any substantive revision, per policy GV-PM-003.\n\n---",
