        order: 9,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | HR Director | Offer hepatitis B vaccination series to all employees with occupational exposure within 10 working days of initial assignment. Document acceptance or declination. | Within 10 working days of assignment. |\n| 6.2.2 | HR Director | Track hepatitis B vaccination series completion (3 doses). Follow up on incomplete series. If employee later reconsiders declination, offer vaccination at that time. | Per vaccination schedule (0, 1, 6 months). |\n| 6.2.3 | HR Director | Coordinate annual influenza vaccination campaign. Document vaccination or declination. | Annually; during influenza season. |\n| 6.2.4 | HR Director | Maintain COVID-19 vaccination records per current CDPH and CMS requirements. | Per current public health guidance. |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "lesson",
