        order: 31,
        body: "### Appendix A — Reasonable Suspicion Documentation Form\n\n| Employee Name | __________________ | Position | __________________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Date/Time of Observation | __________________ | Location | __________________ |\n| Observing Supervisor | __________________ | Corroborating Supervisor | __________________ |\n\n\n| Observable Sign | Observed? | Description |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Odor of alcohol or drugs | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Slurred speech | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Unsteady gait / coordination | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Erratic or unusual behavior | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Bloodshot / dilated eyes | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Inability to perform duties safely | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n| Other | ☐ Yes ☐ No | __________________ |\n\n\n| Action Taken | ☐ Removed from duty ☐ Testing arranged ☐ Transportation arranged |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Supervisor Signature | __________________ |\n| Corroborating Supervisor Signature | __________________ |\n\n### Appendix B — Drug/Alcohol Test Result Action Form\n\n| Employee Name | __________________ | Test Date | ________ | Test Type | ☐ Pre-Emp ☐ Reasonable Suspicion ☐ Post-Accident ☐ Return-to-Duty |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Test Result | ☐ Negative ☐ Positive (Substance: __________) ☐ Refused |  |  |  |  |\n| Employee Explanation | __________________________________________________________________ |  |  |  |  |\n| Valid Prescription Verified? | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ N/A |  |  |  |  |\n| Action Taken | ☐ Return to duty ☐ Disciplinary action per HR-ER-002 ☐ Termination ☐ Last-Chance Agreement ☐ EAP Referral |  |  |  |  |\n| HR Director Signature | __________________ | Date | ________ |  |  |\n\n### Appendix C — Policy Acknowledgment\nI acknowledge receipt and understanding of Policy HR-ER-005 — Substance Abuse & Drug-Free Workplace, Version 6.0.\n\n| Full Name | __________________ | Signature | __________________ | Date | ________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n\nEND OF POLICY HR-ER-005\n\n\n\n# POLICY HR-ER-006\n# Separation & Exit Process\n\n---",
