        order: 17,
        body: "| Failure Point | Risk | Mitigation |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Employee begins work before background check results are received | Survey finding; potential patient safety risk; liability exposure if incident occurs | Enforce zero-exception policy: no work begins until Appendix F is complete and signed. |\n| OIG/SAM screening not completed before start date | CMS may impose civil monetary penalties; potential program exclusion for the agency | Automate OIG/SAM screening as part of pre-employment checklist; HR Director verifies before clearing start date. |\n| Interview questions include prohibited inquiries | EEO complaint; DFEH investigation; litigation risk | Use standardized Appendix C form for all interviews; train all interviewers annually on prohibited inquiries. |\n| No job description on file for a filled position | Surveyor may cite inability to verify qualifications match requirements | Enforce Section 6.1.2: no recruitment proceeds without current job description. |\n| Reference checks not documented | Surveyor finding for incomplete personnel file | Require minimum 2 documented reference contacts with notes per Appendix F before clearing. |\n| Contract staff screening documentation not verified independently | Agency liable for excluded or unqualified contract staff | Enforce Section 6.6: independent OIG/SAM verification regardless of staffing agency attestations. |\n\n---",
