        id: "8-pre-employment-pre-engagement-screening",
        title: "Pre-Employment / Pre-Engagement Screening",
        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1.1 | HR Director (or designee) | For every applicant who has accepted a conditional offer (HR-TA-001): Search the OIG LEIE database (https://exclusions.oig.hhs.gov/) using the individual's: (a) full legal name; (b) any known aliases or maiden names; (c) date of birth (for verification); (d) NPI (if applicable). | Within 2 business days of signed conditional offer. |\n| 6.1.2 | HR Director (or designee) | Search the SAM exclusion database (https://sam.gov/) using the same identifiers as Step 6.1.1. | Simultaneously with LEIE search. |\n| 6.1.3 | HR Director | Document results on the OIG/SAM Screening Result Form (Appendix A): (a) name searched; (b) databases searched; (c) date of search; (d) result (CLEAR or POTENTIAL MATCH); (e) screenshot or printout of search results. If CLEAR, file in personnel file and mark the Pre-Employment Screening Checklist (HR-TA-001, Appendix F) as PASS. | Same day as search. |\n| 6.1.4 | HR Director | If a POTENTIAL MATCH is identified: (a) do not clear the individual to begin work; (b) verify the match using date of birth, SSN (last 4), NPI, address, or other identifying information; (c) contact the OIG hotline (1-800-HHS-TIPS) if verification is inconclusive; (d) document all verification steps on Appendix A. | Verification initiated same day; completed within 3 business days. |\n| 6.1.5 | HR Director | If the match is CONFIRMED (the individual is excluded): notify the Compliance Officer within 24 hours. Rescind the conditional offer immediately in writing. Document the finding and actions taken. | Within 24 hours of confirmation. |\n| 6.1.6 | HR Director | If the match is a FALSE POSITIVE (verified that the individual is not the excluded party): document the false positive verification on Appendix A, mark as CLEAR, and proceed with remaining screening. | Upon verification completion. |\n\n---",
