        body: "### Appendix A — Licensure Expiration Tracking System\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: HR-TA-004 | Version: 6.0\n\n| # | Employee Name | Position | License Type | License # | Issuing State/Board | Issue Date | Expiration Date | 90-Day Reminder Sent | 60-Day Reminder Sent | 30-Day Reminder Sent | Renewed & Verified? | Verification Date | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 2 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 3 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 4 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 5 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 6 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 7 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n| 8 | _________ | _______ | _______ | _______ | _______ | ______ | ______ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ Y ☐ N | ______ | _____ |\n\n\n| Maintained By | __________________ | Last Updated | ________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n\n### Appendix B — Licensure Verification Record\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: HR-TA-004 | Version: 6.0\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Employee / Applicant Name | __________________ |\n| Position | __________________ |\n| Verification Type: ☐ Pre-Employment ☐ Renewal ☐ Annual Re-Verification ☐ Triggered |  |\n\n\n| # | License / Certification Type | License / Cert Number | Issuing Board / Body | State | Verification Method (Website URL / Phone / Written) | Verification Date | Status Confirmed (Active-Unrestricted / Active-Restricted / Expired / Suspended / Revoked) | Expiration Date | Encumbrances / Disciplinary Actions? (Y/N — if Y, describe) |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | _________ | _________ | _________ | ____ | ________________________ | ________ | _________________ | ________ | ☐ Y ☐ N _________ |\n| 2 | _________ | _________ | _________ | ____ | ________________________ | ________ | _________________ | ________ | ☐ Y ☐ N _________ |\n| 3 | _________ | _________ | _________ | ____ | ________________________ | ________ | _________________ | ________ | ☐ Y ☐ N _________ |\n\n☐ Primary source verification evidence attached (screenshot/printout — REQUIRED)\n\n| Verified By (Printed Name) | __________________ | Signature | __________________ | Date | ________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n\n### Appendix C — License Renewal Reminder Notice\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: HR-TA-004 | Version: 6.0\n[Date: ______________]\nTo: [Employee Name] From: HR Director, Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Re: License Renewal Reminder — [License Type] — Expires [Expiration Date]\nThis notice serves as a reminder that your [License Type], License Number [License #], issued by [Issuing Board], is scheduled to expire on [Expiration Date].\nPer agency policy HR-TA-004, you are required to:\nRenew your license before the expiration date.\nProvide evidence of renewal (copy of renewed license or board verification) to the HR Director at least 30 calendar days before expiration.\nUnderstand that if your license expires and you have not provided evidence of renewal, you will be immediately removed from all clinical duties on the expiration date and may be placed on unpaid administrative leave.\nPracticing on an expired license is a violation of California state law and agency policy and may result in disciplinary action up to and including termination.\nIf you have questions or need assistance with the renewal process, please contact the HR Director immediately.\n\n| Notice Level: ☐ 90-Day ☐ 60-Day (cc: Supervisor & DON) ☐ 30-Day (cc: Supervisor, DON & Administrator) |\n| :---- |\n\n\n| HR Director Signature | __________________ | Date Sent | ________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n\n\n| Employee Acknowledgment: ☐ I have received this notice and understand my renewal obligation. |\n| :---- |\n| Employee Signature |\n\n### Appendix D — Licensure Adverse Event Report\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: HR-TA-004 | Version: 6.0\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Employee Name | __________________ |\n| Position | __________________ |\n| License Type | __________________ |\n| License Number | __________________ |\n| Event Type: ☐ License Expired (employee worked on expired) ☐ License Suspended ☐ License Revoked ☐ Restriction/Disciplinary Action Imposed ☐ Other: _____ |  |\n| Date Event Discovered | __________________ |\n| Date Employee Removed from Clinical Duties | __________________ |\n| Discovered By | __________________ |\n| Period Employee Practiced Under Impaired Licensure (if applicable) | From: ________ To: ________ |\n\nPATIENT IMPACT ASSESSMENT\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Did employee provide patient care during the impaired period? | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ Under Review |\n| If yes, number of patients seen | ______ |\n| Any patient harm identified? | ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ Under Review |\n| If yes, describe and cross-reference to QA-AE-001 incident report(s) | __________________________________________________________________ |\n\nCORRECTIVE ACTIONS\n\n| # | Action | Responsible Party | Date |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | Employee removed from clinical duties | HR Director / DON | ________ |\n| 2 | Administrator and Compliance Officer notified | HR Director | ________ |\n| 3 | Patient care review initiated | DON | ________ |\n| 4 | Employment determination made | Administrator | ________ |\n| 5 | Root cause of tracking failure identified | HR Director | ________ |\n| 6 | Tracking system corrective action implemented | HR Director | ________ |\n\n\n| Reported By | __________________ | Signature | __________________ | Date | ________ |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n\n### Appendix E — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: HR-TA-004 | Version: 6.0 | Date: 2025-07-10\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that:\nI have received and read Policy HR-TA-004 — Licensure & Certification Verification, Version 6.0, effective 2025-07-10.\nI understand my personal obligation to maintain current, valid, unrestricted licensure/certification at all times, to renew timely, and to provide evidence of renewal to HR at least 30 days before expiration.\nI understand that I must report any disciplinary action, restriction, suspension, or revocation of my license to the HR Director within 24 hours of receiving notice.\nI understand that practicing on an expired, suspended, or revoked license will result in immediate removal from clinical duties and may result in termination.\nI have had the opportunity to ask questions.\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) | __________________ |\n| Title / Role | __________________ |\n| License Type(s) and Number(s) | __________________ |\n| Signature | __________________ |\n| Date Signed | __________________ |\n\n# POLICY HR-TA-005\n# Employee Orientation & Onboarding\n\n---",
