        level: 2,
        order: 6,
        body: "| Term | Definition |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Continuing Education (CE) | Structured educational activities designed to maintain, develop, or enhance the knowledge, skills, and professional competence of licensed professionals, as required by their licensing boards. |\n| CE Unit / Contact Hour | The standard measurement of continuing education. One contact hour typically equals 50-60 minutes of educational activity. CE requirements vary by profession and state. |\n| Approved Provider | An organization or institution accredited or approved by the applicable licensing board or recognized accrediting body to offer continuing education. |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
