        title: "Student Onboarding",
        level: 3,
        order: 9,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | HR Director | Before the student begins: (a) Verify student identity; (b) Conduct OIG/SAM screening per HR-TA-003; (c) Verify current student liability/malpractice insurance; (d) Obtain signed Confidentiality and HIPAA Agreement (Appendix B); (e) Conduct abbreviated orientation per HR-TA-005, Appendix C. | Before first day of placement. |\n| 6.2.2 | Assigned Preceptor | Meet with the student to review: (a) learning objectives; (b) schedule; (c) supervision expectations; (d) patient safety requirements; (e) documentation standards; (f) communication/escalation protocols. | First day of placement. |\n\n---",
