        title: "Supervision and Evaluation",
        level: 3,
        order: 10,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.3.1 | Preceptor | Provide direct supervision for all patient care activities. Complete the Student Performance Evaluation Form (Appendix C) at the midpoint and end of the placement. | Midpoint and end of placement. |\n| 6.3.2 | Director of Nursing | Review student evaluations. Address any concerns. Provide written evaluation summary to the educational institution per the affiliation agreement. | Within 14 days of placement end. |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "lesson",
