        title: "Emergency Drills/Exercises",
        level: 3,
        order: 9,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.2.1 | Administrator / Risk Manager | Plan and schedule at least 2 emergency exercises per year per Section 4.2. Document the exercise plan using the Emergency Exercise Planning Form (Appendix A). | Exercise 1: by June 30. Exercise 2: by December 31. |\n| 6.2.2 | Administrator / Risk Manager | Conduct the exercise. Document participation using the Exercise Participation Log (Appendix B). | Per schedule. |\n| 6.2.3 | Administrator / Risk Manager | Within 14 calendar days of each exercise, conduct and document an After-Action Review (Appendix C) including: (a) exercise description; (b) participants; (c) objectives met and not met; (d) strengths identified; (e) gaps/weaknesses identified; (f) corrective actions with assigned owners and deadlines. | Within 14 calendar days of exercise. |\n| 6.2.4 | Administrator | Report exercise results and AAR findings to the Governing Body per GV-GB-001 § 6.2.6.2 and to QAPI. | At the quarterly meeting following the exercise. |\n\n---",
