        level: 2,
        order: 3,
        body: "This policy defines the geographic boundaries within which Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. provides home health services and establishes standards for ensuring adequate coverage throughout the defined service area. CMS requires that a home health agency serve patients within a defined geographic area and that the agency be operationally capable of providing timely, consistent services throughout that area per 42 CFR § 484.105.\n\n---",
