        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 5.1.1 | Operations Director | Maintain the current service area map and boundary list (Appendix A). The service area shall be defined by: (a) county boundaries; (b) ZIP code list; (c) maximum travel radius from agency office (if applicable). | Continuous; updated as changes occur. |\n| 5.1.2 | Operations Director | Submit the service area definition to the Administrator for approval annually. Present to the Governing Body at the second quarterly meeting. | Annually. |\n| 5.1.3 | Operations Director | Ensure the service area on file with CMS (Form CMS-855A) and the California HCAI matches the agency's operational service area. Notify the Administrator immediately of any discrepancy. | Verified annually; discrepancy reported immediately. |\n\n---",
