        body: "| Requirement | Document | Responsible Party | Location | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| On-call schedule | Monthly on-call rotation | Operations Director | Operations file | Monthly |\n| After-hours contact documentation | After-Hours Contact Log (Appendix B) + clinical record entry | On-Call Clinician | Operations file; patient record | Within 2 hours of resolution |\n| After-hours visit note | Full clinical visit note in EHR | On-Call Clinician | Patient record | Within 24 hours |\n| Weekly after-hours review | Clinical Manager review documentation | Clinical Manager | Operations file | Weekly |\n| Quarterly after-hours report | QAPI report | Operations Director | QAPI records | Quarterly |\n\n---",
