        order: 29,
        body: "10.1 All individuals who may serve as RCA Leads or RCA Team members shall receive formal training in RCA methodology within 30 calendar days of their first assignment. Training must cover: (a) RCA purpose and principles; (b) 5 Whys technique; (c) Fishbone diagram construction; (d) interview techniques; (e) distinguishing root causes from contributing factors; (f) writing root causes in system terms; (g) developing measurable corrective recommendations.\n10.2 The QAPI Coordinator shall maintain a roster of trained RCA facilitators and ensure at least 3 agency staff are trained at all times.\n10.3 All personnel within scope shall sign the Policy Acknowledgment Form within 14 calendar days.\n\n---",
