        title: "CAP Initiation",
        level: 3,
        order: 8,
        body: "| Step | Responsible Party | Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 6.1.1 | QAPI Coordinator | Initiate a CAP when any trigger condition in Section 4.1 is met. Document the trigger in the QAPI Corrective Action Tracker (Appendix B). | Within 7 calendar days of trigger event. |\n| 6.1.2 | QAPI Coordinator | Assign a CAP Lead. The CAP Lead must: (a) have operational authority in the area affected by the deficiency; (b) have access to relevant data and personnel; (c) be accountable for implementation and reporting. | At time of initiation. |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "lesson",
