        id: "6-definitions",
        title: "5\\. Definitions",
        level: 2,
        order: 6,
        body: "| Term | Definition |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Competency Evaluation | The systematic assessment of a staff member's knowledge, skills, and abilities to perform their job functions safely and effectively, per HR-TD-003. |\n| Systemic Competency Pattern | A recurring competency deficiency identified in 3 or more staff members within a 12-month period, or a single deficiency correlated with an adverse event or quality indicator decline. |\n| Competency-Quality Correlation | An identified relationship between a staff competency area and a quality indicator, adverse event type, or patient outcome measure. |\n\n---",
