        order: 2,
        body: "| Field | Value |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Policy ID | QA-SM-003 |\n| Title | Patient Satisfaction Survey & Analysis |\n| Domain | QA — Quality Assurance & Performance Improvement |\n| Subdomain | SM — Surveillance & Monitoring |\n| Classification Tier | ESSENTIAL |\n| Access Tier | Tier 2 — Restricted |\n| Version | 6.0 |\n| Effective Date | 2025-07-10 |\n| Approved By | Governing Body Chair — Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. |\n| Policy Owner/Steward | QAPI Coordinator |\n| Last Reviewed | 2025-07-10 |\n| Next Review Date | 2026-07-10 |\n| Review Cycle | Annual |\n| Status | ACTIVE |\n| Supersedes | N/A (Initial Version) |\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
