        order: 14,
        body: "| Condition | Escalation Path | Corrective Action | Timeframe |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Either Star Rating falls to 3 stars or below. | QAPI Coordinator notifies Administrator and Governing Body immediately. | Star Rating Improvement Plan per Section 6.4.1 within 30 days; Governing Body oversight until 4 stars restored. | Plan within 30 days; monthly Governing Body updates. |\n| Agency falls below national average on 5 or more publicly reported measures simultaneously. | QAPI Coordinator escalates to Administrator and Governing Body. | Comprehensive QAPI plan review and possible special Governing Body session to reassess resources and priorities. | Within 30 days of identification. |\n| CMS data correction not submitted within the preview window for identified inaccurate data. | QAPI Coordinator notifies Administrator. | Administrator and Compliance Officer assess corrective options; document the gap and root cause. | Within 5 business days of window closing. |\n| HH QRP participation penalty applied (2% payment reduction). | QAPI Coordinator notifies CFO and Administrator. | Immediate assessment of submission compliance; corrective action to restore full participation per CO-RA-001. | Within 5 business days of penalty notification. |\n\n---",
