        body: "CMS surveyors conducting a standard survey will verify:\nEvidence of a structured risk management program. Surveyors will request the ERM charter, program manual, and Risk Register.\nEvidence of Governing Body oversight of risk. Surveyors will review Governing Body minutes for documented risk report presentation and action.\nEvidence that risks are identified, assessed, and mitigated. Surveyors will select specific risks from the Register and trace through identification, assessment, mitigation plan, and resolution.\nIntegration with QAPI. Surveyors will verify that risk data informs the QAPI program and that adverse event data flows into the risk management process.\nIncident reporting processes. Surveyors will verify the existence and functioning of the incident reporting system per RM-ER-002.\nStaff awareness. Surveyors may interview staff regarding their understanding of how to report risks and incidents.\n\n---",
