        id: "5-policy-statements",
        title: "4\\. Policy Statements",
        level: 2,
        order: 5,
        body: "4.1 All claims, demand letters, lawsuits, subpoenas, and notices of potential claims received by any agency employee shall be immediately forwarded to the Risk Manager.\n4.2 The Risk Manager shall notify the applicable insurance carrier(s) within 24 hours of receiving any claim or notice of potential claim per RM-ER-004.\n4.3 A litigation hold shall be issued within 24 hours of receiving any lawsuit, demand letter, or credible notice of potential litigation.\n4.4 No agency employee shall discuss claims, litigation, or potential litigation with any external party (including claimants, their attorneys, or media) without authorization from the Risk Manager or legal counsel.\n4.5 The Governing Body shall be notified of all claims and lawsuits per GV-GB-001 §6.5.\n4.6 All claims management activities shall be coordinated with the agency's legal counsel per GV-EA-003.\n\n---",
