        level: 2,
        order: 30,
        body: "Per RM-ER-001 §10.\n### Appendix A — Elopement/Wandering Risk Screening Tool\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: RM-PS-004 | Version: 6.0\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name | ________________________________ |\n| MRN | ________________________________ |\n| Assessment Date | //________ |\n| Assessed By | ________________________________ |\n| Assessment Type | ☐ Initial (SOC/ROC) ☐ Recertification ☐ Reassessment (Trigger: ____________) |\n\n#### RISK FACTOR EVALUATION\n\n| # | Risk Factor | Yes | No | Unknown | Detail |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | Diagnosis of dementia, Alzheimer's disease, or other cognitive impairment? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 2 | BIMS score ≤12 (indicating moderate-severe cognitive impairment)? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | BIMS Score: ________ |\n| 3 | Disorientation to person, place, time, or situation? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 4 | History of wandering or elopement? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | When/Frequency: ____________ |\n| 5 | Exit-seeking behavior observed or reported? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 6 | Behavioral agitation, restlessness, or sundowning? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 7 | Lives alone or has periods without supervision? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | Hours unsupervised: ________ |\n| 8 | Home lacks security features (door alarms, secure locks, fencing)? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 9 | Proximity to hazards (busy road, water, steep terrain, extreme climate)? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n| 10 | New or changed medication affecting cognition/behavior? | ☐ | ☐ | ☐ | ________________________________ |\n\nTOTAL \"YES\" RESPONSES: ________\n#### RISK CLASSIFICATION\n\n| Classification | Criteria | Selected |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| LOW RISK | 0 \"Yes\" responses; no history; cognitively intact | ☐ |\n| MODERATE RISK | 1–2 \"Yes\" responses; adequate supervision typically present | ☐ |\n| HIGH RISK | 3+ \"Yes\" responses; OR any history of elopement; OR inadequate supervision with cognitive impairment | ☐ |\n\nSafety Plan Required? ☐ Yes (Moderate/High Risk) — Complete Appendix B ☐ No (Low Risk — Standard monitoring)\nAssessor Signature: ________________________________ Date: //________\n### Appendix B — Elopement/Wandering Safety Plan\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: RM-PS-004 | Version: 6.0\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Patient Name | ________________________________ |\n| MRN | ________________________________ |\n| Risk Classification | ☐ Moderate ☐ High |\n| Plan Developed By | ________________________________ |\n| Date | //________ |\n\n#### IDENTIFIED RISK FACTORS\n#### INTERVENTIONS\n\n| # | Intervention | Responsible Party | Target Date | Status |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | Environmental modifications: ________________________________ | ____________ | //____ | ☐ Not Started ☐ In Progress ☐ Complete |\n| 2 | Supervision recommendations: ________________________________ | ____________ | //____ | ☐ Not Started ☐ In Progress ☐ Complete |\n| 3 | Caregiver education: ________________________________ | ____________ | //____ | ☐ Not Started ☐ In Progress ☐ Complete |\n| 4 | Referrals: ☐ Alzheimer's Assn Safe Return ☐ GPS device ☐ Community resources ☐ Other: ____________ | ____________ | //____ | ☐ Not Started ☐ In Progress ☐ Complete |\n| 5 | ID bracelet/necklace recommended? ☐ Yes ☐ No ☐ Already in place | ____________ | //____ | ☐ Not Started ☐ In Progress ☐ Complete |\n\n#### EMERGENCY RESPONSE PLAN (If Elopement Occurs)\n\n| Step | Action |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| 1 | Search immediate vicinity and home. |\n| 2 | Call 911 if not found within 15 minutes. Provide: physical description, cognitive status, medical conditions, medications, last known location. |\n| 3 | Request Silver Alert activation (if applicable). |\n| 4 | Notify emergency contacts: ________________________________ Phone: ____________ |\n| 5 | Notify agency: ________________________________ Phone: ____________ |\n| 6 | Notify physician: ________________________________ Phone: ____________ |\n\nPatient Physical Description (for emergency use):\n\n| Feature | Description |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Height | ________ |\n| Weight | ________ |\n| Hair Color | ________ |\n| Eye Color | ________ |\n| Distinguishing Features | ________________________________ |\n| Recent Photograph on File? | ☐ Yes ☐ No |\n\n#### PLAN REVIEW SCHEDULE\n☐ Every 30 days ☐ Every 60 days ☐ At recertification ☐ Upon any elopement event ☐ Upon cognitive status change\nPhysician Notified? ☐ Yes — Date: //____ Physician: ________________________________\nCaregiver Acknowledgment: I have been informed of the elopement/wandering risk for the above-named patient and the safety plan. I understand my role in monitoring and the emergency response plan.\nCaregiver Name: ________________________________ Signature: ________________________________ Date: //________\nClinician Signature: ________________________________ Date: //________ Supervisor Review Signature: ________________________________ Date: //________\n### Appendix C — Policy Acknowledgment Form\nCare Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. Policy Reference: RM-PS-004 | Version: 6.0\nI, the undersigned, acknowledge that I have received, read, and understand Policy RM-PS-004 — Patient Elopement & Wandering Risk, Version 6.0.\n\n| Field | Entry |\n| :---- | :---- |\n| Full Name (Printed) | ________________________________ |\n| Title / Role | ________________________________ |\n| Signature | ________________________________ |\n| Date Signed | //________ |\n\n---",
