        title: "1\\. Purpose",
        level: 2,
        order: 3,
        body: "This policy establishes standards for motor vehicle safety, driving eligibility, accident reporting, and investigation procedures for all personnel of Care Indeed Home Health Care, Inc. who operate motor vehicles for agency business. Home health services require extensive driving in variable conditions, and motor vehicle accidents represent a significant risk to staff safety, patient service continuity, agency liability, and insurance costs.\n\n---",
        scormChunkHint: "module",
